5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Welcome, friends. Let us listen to the silence between words to find truth.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Logic is our shield. I will watch for inconsistencies in your stories.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I’m Sakura. I feel a spark of mystery here. Let’s have fun!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello. I am Midori. I value harmony, so let’s speak kindly and clearly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am Ryuji. I observe patterns. Do not force conclusions before the data is clear.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from patience. Do not rush to judge; let the night reveal its secrets.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Patience is good, but hesitation is dangerous. We must be decisive when evidence appears.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"I like Mizuki’s energy! But don’t be too scary, okay? I’m just a curious girl.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Mizuki. Balance is key. We should be gentle but firm in our observations.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Emotion clouds judgment. Stick to facts. If you claim innocence, provide a reason.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"The heart speaks before the mind. Trust your instincts, but verify with logic.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Instincts can be manipulated. I rely on structure. Who among you feels most exposed?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, that’s a spicy question! I feel safe, but I’m watching Ryuji closely.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,I feel safe too. Let’s not point fingers too early. We are all in this together.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Sakura, your attention is noted. I do not hide. I simply wait for the night to speak.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,The night is coming. May it bring clarity to our weary souls.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Clarity is what we seek. I will analyze every word you say from now on.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Goodnight, everyone! I hope we find the wolf before it finds us. Bye!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Goodnight. Let’s rest well. I’ll be here, ready to support whatever decision we make.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,Rest. I will be thinking. The first divination will set the tone for tomorrow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
