31,1,1,talk,Servas,,The night has passed. Who among us carries the weight of the moon’s gaze?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The Seer’s result is private, but the reaction is public. Who looks most nervous?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I’m not nervous! I’m excited! But I did see Ryuji fidgeting a bit earlier.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,I don’t see any nervousness. Everyone seems calm. Let’s not jump to conclusions.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am the Seer. I have verified one player. I will not name them yet.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"A bold claim, Ryuji. The Seer’s burden is heavy. Do you trust your vision?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"If you are the Seer, your silence is strategic. But why hide the result?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Hiding it makes it look suspicious! Maybe you’re the wolf pretending to be the Seer?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Sakura, please. Accusing without proof causes discord. Let’s hear Ryuji’s full explanation.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I hide the result to prevent the wolf from adapting. I have verified Servas as human.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I am honored by your trust, Ryuji. My soul is clear, as I have always been.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Servas is human. That leaves four suspects. I will focus on the remaining three.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! Servas is safe! Now, who is the next one to check? I want to know!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I appreciate the clarity. Let’s discuss the behavior of Mizuki, Sakura, and myself.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,Servas is human. The wolf is among the others. I will observe their reactions to this news.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us proceed with wisdom. The truth will emerge from the interplay of our words.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I accept the scrutiny. My logic is sound. I am not the wolf.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I’m definitely not the wolf! I’m too clumsy to be a sneaky werewolf. Ha!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,I am a villager. I seek peace. I hope we can find the wolf without hurting anyone.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I have my suspicions. I will vote based on the consistency of your statements.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
